                     <note>9:94-11:5. Triple dots as verse markers. Ihmāl marks (rā', sīn). Sīn with and without teeth. On almost all folios, words completed on the following line. Deletions. Religious formulas "lā ilaha illā huwa" and "lā ilaha illā allaḏī amanta bihi" enhanced (takbīr &amp; talwīn, 6v, 15r). Irregular catchwords, written later than the matn. </note>
